    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Truncate Range"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "EZI_pVNpgaZU"
      },
      "id": "EZI_pVNpgaZU"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Because the entire time range and geographic coverage are relevant to the study issue and contribute to maintaining the overall integrity of the trend, the dataset was not trimmed. Especially in time-series analysis, deleting portions of the data may cause bias or skew longitudinal patterns. Furthermore, no obvious structural discontinuities or extraneous areas were found that would support limiting the scope."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "B6fsYdAggePX"
      },
      "id": "B6fsYdAggePX"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### Merge Datasets"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "wStIXVd_gjDe"
      },
      "id": "wStIXVd_gjDe"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# get rid of rows without a specific US state attached\n",
        "data_jobs_state = data_jobs[~data_jobs['state'].isin(['Other'])]\n",
        "salary_month_by_states_only = data_jobs_state.groupby(\n",
        "    ['state', pd.Grouper(freq='ME')]\n",
        ")['salary_yearly'].median()\n",
        "\n",
        "# convert the multi-index salary series into a DataFrame\n",
        "salary_monthly_by_state_df = salary_month_by_states_only.reset_index()\n",
        "\n",
        "# convert COL series into a DataFrame\n",
        "col_by_state_df = col_by_state.reset_index()\n",
        "\n",
        "# merge on state\n",
        "merged_monthly_salary = salary_monthly_by_state_df.merge(col_by_state_df, on='state', how='left')\n",
        "merged_monthly_salary.sample(5)\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
          "height": 206
        },
        "id": "QRKMlxWR5qXF",
        "outputId": "cd9ee124-f0e2-4c4c-d035-0b67901db0c1"
      },
      "id": "QRKMlxWR5qXF",
      "execution_count": 30,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "execute_result",
